# Gallery slideshow smoke (FrontEnd world 69802220,cee3af0d, run with SKIP_FRONTEND=0): `gallery 63`
# unlocks all six galleries (a forced ShowSlideShow with mask 0 faults in retail too), `send e0
# InternalMessage13` is ShowSlideShow. The game's first update is ~70 s in and the slideshow loads
# its pak for a few seconds after that; it stops the update counter, so the steps are wall-clock
# (`@<secs>`) and a hold lasts until the next press/stick, so each press is released with `stick 0 0`.
# Press right x2 (slides), a, left (gallery wraps), then B leaves; the run ends on MP2_FRAMES.
# The game logs `[slideshow] phase/gallery/slide` as it goes.
@f100 send e0 Unlock
@f110 gallery
@f120 gallery 63
@f200 send e0 InternalMessage13
@95 press right 0
@97 stick 0 0
@99 press right 0
@101 stick 0 0
@103 press a 0
@105 stick 0 0
@107 press left 0
@109 stick 0 0
@111 press b 0
@113 stick 0 0
@115 status
